
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Travel Guide Hub | Explore Flights & Destinations</title>

<meta name="description" content="Explore airline guides, flight information, destination inspiration and useful travel tips to plan your next journey with confidence.">

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: #18314d;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.container {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 1150px;
  margin: auto;
}

header {
  background: white;
  padding: 20px 0;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px #00000010;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #12345a;
}

nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #18314d;
  margin-left: 22px;
  font-weight: bold;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: #1684d8;
}

.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #092849, #147dc1);
  color: white;
  padding: 100px 0;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 48px;
  max-width: 700px;
  line-height: 1.2;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 18px;
  max-width: 650px;
  color: #e1efff;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  background: white;
  color: #12345a;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  border-radius: 7px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
}

section {
  padding: 70px 0;
}

.heading {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.heading h2 {
  font-size: 34px;
  color: #102f52;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.heading p {
  color: #687b90;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 25px;
}

.card {
  padding: 28px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid #e5edf5;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #102f5210;
  transition: .3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-6px);
}

.card .icon {
  font-size: 38px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card h3 {
  color: #12345a;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
  color: #687b90;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.card a {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 15px;
  color: #147dc1;
  font-weight: bold;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.destinations {
  background: #f2f8fd;
}

.destination-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 18px;
}

.destination {
  height: 210px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: end;
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  color: white;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, #071e38), 
              linear-gradient(135deg, #7dc5e9, #164b79);
}

.destination h3 {
  font-size: 23px;
}

.blog-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 25px;
}

.blog {
  border: 1px solid #e5edf5;
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.blog-image {
  height: 150px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  font-size: 55px;
  background: #e5f3ff;
}

.blog-content {
  padding: 22px;
}

.blog h3 {
  margin: 10px 0;
  color: #12345a;
}

.blog p {
  color: #687b90;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.about {
  background: #f2f8fd;
}

.about-content {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
}

.about-content p {
  color: #687b90;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.cta {
  background: #0c3157;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 50px 25px;
}

.cta h2 {
  font-size: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.cta p {
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

footer {
  background: #081f39;
  color: white;
  padding: 45px 0 20px;
}

.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 30px;
}

footer h3 {
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

footer p, footer a {
  color: #c6d8e9;
  font-size: 14px;
}

footer a {
  display: block;
  text-decoration: none;
  margin: 8px 0;
}

.copyright {
  text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid #29425d;
  margin-top: 30px;
  padding-top: 20px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #a9bfd3;
}

@media(max-width: 768px) {
  nav {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  nav a {
    margin: 5px;
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: 36px;
  }

  .cards, .blog-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .destination-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  }

  .footer-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">✈ Travel Guide Hub</div>
      <div>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#guides">Airline Guides</a>
        <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
        <a href="#blog">Travel Tips</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Explore the World with Smarter Travel Planning</h1>
    <p>
      Discover helpful airline information, explore beautiful
      destinations and find practical travel tips to make
      every journey easier and more memorable.
    </p>
    <a href="#guides" class="btn">Explore Travel Guides →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="guides">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading">
      <h2>Discover Our Travel Resources</h2>
      <p>Helpful information for planning your next adventure.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">✈️</div>
        <h3>Airline Guides</h3>
        <p>Explore information about airline baggage,
        check-in procedures, seat selection and flight policies.</p>
        <a href="#blog">Explore Guides →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🌍</div>
        <h3>Destination Guides</h3>
        <p>Discover popular cities, exciting attractions
        and useful ideas for your next holiday.</p>
        <a href="#destinations">Explore Destinations →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🧳</div>
        <h3>Travel Tips</h3>
        <p>Get practical suggestions for packing,
        airport preparation and comfortable journeys.</p>
        <a href="#blog">Read Travel Tips →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="destinations" id="destinations">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading">
      <h2>Explore Beautiful Destinations</h2>
      <p>Find inspiration for your next memorable journey.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="destination-grid">
      <div class="destination"><h3>Paris, France</h3></div>
      <div class="destination"><h3>London, UK</h3></div>
      <div class="destination"><h3>Rome, Italy</h3></div>
      <div class="destination"><h3>Amsterdam</h3></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="blog">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="heading">
      <h2>Latest Travel Tips & Guides</h2>
      <p>Useful ideas to help you prepare for your next flight.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="blog-grid">
      <div class="blog">
        <div class="blog-image">🛫</div>
        <div class="blog-content">
          <h3>Tips for a Smooth Airport Experience</h3>
          <p>Learn how to organise travel documents,
          prepare your luggage and plan your airport arrival.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="blog">
        <div class="blog-image">💺</div>
        <div class="blog-content">
          <h3>How to Choose the Right Airline Seat</h3>
          <p>Understand seat locations, comfort,
          legroom and the options available during booking.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="blog">
        <div class="blog-image">👨‍👩‍👧</div>
        <div class="blog-content">
          <h3>Planning a Memorable Group Trip</h3>
          <p>Explore useful ways to organise group travel,
          coordinate schedules and prepare for your journey.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-content">
      <h2>About Our Travel Information Website</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to make air travel easier to understand through
        helpful airline information, destination inspiration
        and practical travel planning resources.
        Our goal is to help readers prepare for journeys
        with greater confidence.
      </p>
      <p>
        Airline policies, fares and travel requirements may
        change. Always confirm important information with
        the airline or relevant official authority.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta">
      <h2>Ready for Your Next Journey?</h2>
      <p>Discover more airline-focused travel information and helpful resources.</p>
      <a href="https://travelobliss.com/"
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener noreferrer"
         class="btn">Visit Travelobliss →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div>
        <h3>✈ Travel Guide Hub</h3>
        <p>
          Explore airline guides, travel tips and destination
          inspiration to make every journey easier to plan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Explore</h3>
        <a href="#guides">Airline Guides</a>
        <a href="#destinations">Destinations</a>
        <a href="#blog">Travel Tips</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Useful Links</h3>
        <a href="#about">About Us</a>
        <a href="https://travelobliss.com/">Travelobliss</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="copyright">
      © 2026 Travel Guide Hub. All Rights Reserved.
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
